<a id="BitSet"></a>
## `BitSet`

```sisu
pub struct BitSet
    words: list[u64]

impl Len for BitSet
impl Contains[int] for BitSet
```

A set of small non-negative integers, one bit each, in 64-bit words.

```sisu
var b = BitSet.new()
b.insert(3)
b.insert(64)
b.insert(3)
assert b.contains(64) and not b.contains(4)
assert len(b) == 2
b.remove(3)
assert b.members() == [64]
```

